/*
  Synopsis: the welcome text on the home page, from Erin's draft wording
  (DRAFT WORDING, "Front page", 8 November 2026).

  The quote's credit needs checking before launch (AGENTS.md, section 8):
  it says "Miriam Webster", but the dictionary is Merriam-Webster, and the
  quote itself hasn't been checked against the source. It's flagged on the
  page so it can't go live unnoticed.

  Mustard text on maroon: approved pair 8.50:1.

  Props: none.
